OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA humid day, with a mixture of
OL,6,Fsunny spells and a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers, mostly over Devon, Cornwall
OL,8,Fand Somerset. Some of these could be
OL,9,Fheavy and thundery in places. Drier
OL,10,Ffurther east. Feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsunnier moments.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continuing in the
OL,14,Fwest but easing by dawn. The east will
OL,15,Fsee showers later in the night, some
OL,16,Fbeing heavy and thundery. A mild night
OL,17,Fto come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
